"""Class 10 NEW writing sets 6-10."""
from eng.w10n_a import L, A, g, FL, FA, tbl, AP
NEWB = {}; ANA = {}; G_NEW = {}
NEWB[6] = L("You are Pooja/Pankaj of 12, Gandhi Path, Jaipur. You bought a pressure cooker from 'HomeStar Appliances', Jaipur, which stopped working after a week. Write a letter in 100–120 words to the Manager, complaining about the defect and asking for a replacement.", "12, Gandhi Path<br>Jaipur<br>12 November 2026<br>The Manager<br>HomeStar Appliances<br>Jaipur<br>Subject: Complaint about a defective pressure cooker<br>Sir/Madam,<br>On 2 November 2026 I bought a 5-litre pressure cooker (Bill No. 4521) from your showroom. Unfortunately, the lid does not close properly, and steam leaks from the sides after a week's use, which is dangerous. I request you to replace the cooker at the earliest or refund the money. I am enclosing a copy of the bill. If I do not receive a reply within a week, I shall be compelled to approach the consumer forum.<br>Yours faithfully<br>Pooja/Pankaj" + FL)
ANA[6] = (A(AP + "<br><b>Reasons for road accidents in a city (per cent)</b>" + tbl(["Reason", "Share"], [["Over-speeding", "40%"], ["Not wearing helmets/seat belts", "25%"], ["Use of mobile phones", "20%"], ["Poor roads", "15%"]]), "The table lists the causes of road accidents in a city. Over-speeding is the major cause, with 40 per cent, followed by the failure to wear helmets or seat belts at 25 per cent. Mobile phone use accounts for 20 per cent, while poor roads cause 15 per cent. It is notable that 85 per cent of the accidents are caused by human behaviour rather than road conditions. Strict fines for over-speeding, compulsory use of helmets and a ban on the use of phones while driving can reduce accidents. Awareness campaigns in schools will also help build the habit of safe driving." + FA),
      A(AP + "<br><b>Books borrowed from a school library in a month</b>" + tbl(["Type of book", "Number borrowed"], [["Story books", "240"], ["Science and general knowledge", "120"], ["Reference books", "40"], ["Magazines", "100"]]), "The table gives the number of books borrowed from a school library in a month, a total of 500. Story books are the most popular, with 240 borrowed, which is nearly half the total. Science and general knowledge books are second with 120, followed by magazines at 100. Reference books are borrowed least, at only 40. This shows that students read mainly for pleasure and use reference material rarely. The librarian can promote reference books by arranging project work and quizzes which require them. Teachers can also assign topics that require research so that students can enjoy both fiction and fact." + FA))
G_NEW[6] = [g("Edit: She is better than any other girls in the class.", "She is better than any other girl in the class."),
            g("Fill in the blank with the correct tense: By the time we arrived, the film ______ (start).", "had started.")]
NEWB[7] = L("You are Seema/Sameer, a student of Class 10 at Mastermind Public School, Jaipur. Write a letter in 100–120 words to the Director of 'Skill Plus Institute', Jaipur, enquiring about the fees, duration and timing of a summer course in spoken English.", "Mastermind Public School<br>Jaipur<br>15 November 2026<br>The Director<br>Skill Plus Institute<br>Jaipur<br>Subject: Enquiry about the spoken English course<br>Sir/Madam,<br>I have read your advertisement in 'The Daily Pioneer' regarding a summer course in spoken English. Kindly send me details of the course, including the fees, the duration, the timing of classes and the qualification of the teachers. Please also let me know if any discount is given to school students and if a certificate is awarded at the end. I shall be thankful for an early reply.<br>Yours faithfully<br>Seema/Sameer" + FL)
ANA[7] = (A(AP + "<br><b>Tourists visiting a heritage city (in thousands)</b>" + tbl(["Year", "Indian tourists", "Foreign tourists"], [["2022", "300", "40"], ["2023", "380", "70"], ["2024", "450", "110"]]), "The table shows the number of tourists visiting a heritage city in three years. Indian visitors rose from 300 thousand in 2022 to 450 thousand in 2024, an increase of 150 thousand. Foreign visitors grew even faster, from 40 to 110 thousand, which is almost three times. The rising trend suggests that the city is becoming more popular. To sustain this growth, the authorities must improve hotels, roads and cleanliness, provide trained guides and protect monuments from damage. Tourism can then become an important source of income for local people." + FA),
      A(AP + "<br><b>Students opting for streams after Class 10 (per cent)</b>" + tbl(["Stream", "Share"], [["Science", "48%"], ["Commerce", "30%"], ["Arts", "17%"], ["Vocational", "5%"]]), "The table shows the percentage of students opting for different streams after Class 10. Almost half the students, 48 per cent, choose Science, followed by Commerce with 30 per cent. Arts attracts 17 per cent, and vocational courses only 5 per cent. This shows that most students prefer the traditional streams and that vocational training is not very popular. Career counselling in schools can make students aware of the range of options, such as skills-based courses that lead to early employment. Choices should be based on interest and ability and not on peer pressure." + FA))
G_NEW[7] = [g("Edit: Neither Ravi nor his brothers is at home.", "Neither Ravi nor his brothers are at home."),
            g("Fill in the blank with the correct preposition: The thief jumped ______ the wall.", "over.")]
NEWB[8] = L("You are Lata/Lalit, a resident of 8, Shiv Colony, Udaipur. Write a letter in 100–120 words to the Editor of a local daily about the problem of stray cattle on the roads of your locality and suggest solutions.", "8, Shiv Colony<br>Udaipur<br>18 November 2026<br>The Editor<br>The Lake City Herald<br>Udaipur<br>Subject: Menace of stray cattle<br>Sir/Madam,<br>Through your newspaper I wish to draw the attention of the authorities to the growing number of stray cattle on the roads of Shiv Colony. They block traffic and cause accidents, and even children have been injured. I suggest that the municipal corporation set up more shelters, penalise owners who leave animals on the roads and arrange for the collection of leftover food and plastic that the animals eat. Citizens should also not throw waste on the roadside. I hope immediate action will be taken.<br>Yours faithfully<br>Lata/Lalit" + FL)
ANA[8] = (A(AP + "<br><b>Waste generated by a school in a week (kg)</b>" + tbl(["Type", "Quantity"], [["Paper", "120"], ["Plastic", "40"], ["Food waste", "60"], ["Others", "30"]]), "The table gives the waste generated by a school in a week, 250 kg in all. Paper forms the largest part at 120 kg, nearly half the total. Food waste is 60 kg and plastic is 40 kg, while other items make up 30 kg. Since paper is recyclable, the school can reduce waste by collecting and selling it to recyclers and by using both sides of sheets. Food waste can be converted into compost for the school garden, and the use of plastic can be restricted. These measures will reduce expenditure and teach students to respect the environment." + FA),
      A(AP + "<br><b>Hours of sports practice and number of medals won by four schools</b>" + tbl(["School", "Practice hours per week", "Medals won"], [["A", "12", "9"], ["B", "8", "5"], ["C", "5", "2"], ["D", "3", "1"]]), "The table relates weekly practice to the medals won by four schools. School A, which practises for 12 hours a week, won nine medals, while School D with only three hours won one. The medals increase steadily with the number of hours, which suggests that regular practice leads to success. However, the data cover only four schools and do not show the quality of coaching or facilities. Schools that wish to do well should schedule at least ten hours of practice a week, appoint trained coaches and provide good equipment." + FA))
G_NEW[8] = [g("Edit: Mathematics are a difficult subject for him.", "Mathematics is a difficult subject for him."),
            g("Fill in the blank with a suitable determiner: ______ of my two sisters lives in Delhi. (not both)", "Neither.")]
NEWB[9] = L("You are Madhu/Manoj of Alwar. You have seen an advertisement for the post of a part-time library assistant in 'City Public Library'. Write an application in 100–120 words to the Librarian, giving your qualifications.", "7, Adarsh Nagar<br>Alwar<br>20 November 2026<br>The Librarian<br>City Public Library<br>Alwar<br>Subject: Application for part-time library assistant<br>Sir/Madam,<br>With reference to your advertisement in 'The Rajasthan Patrika' dated 18 November 2026, I wish to apply for the post of part-time library assistant. I am a student of Class 10 and have secured 85 per cent marks in Class 9. I am a regular reader and have been the library prefect of my school for a year. I am available after 4 p.m. and on holidays. I assure you of sincere and careful work. I shall be happy to appear for an interview at any time.<br>Yours faithfully<br>Madhu/Manoj" + FL)
ANA[9] = (A(AP + "<br><b>Reasons why students use a phone in class (survey of 100 students)</b>" + tbl(["Reason", "Students"], [["To message friends", "40"], ["To play games", "30"], ["To look up information", "20"], ["Emergency calls", "10"]]), "The table gives the reasons why 100 students use their phones in class. Messaging friends tops the list with 40 students, followed by playing games with 30. Only 20 students use the phone to look up information, and 10 for emergency calls. Thus 70 per cent of the use is purely for entertainment and not related to study. This shows that phones can be a source of distraction in the classroom. Schools may require phones to be deposited at the entrance and permit supervised use for educational purposes. Students should realise that attention during lessons is essential to success." + FA),
      A(AP + "<br><b>Rainfall in a district (mm)</b>" + tbl(["Month", "2022", "2023"], [["July", "180", "260"], ["August", "220", "300"], ["September", "100", "140"]]), "The table gives the rainfall of the three monsoon months in two years. In every month the rainfall in 2023 exceeded that of 2022. July rose from 180 to 260 mm, August from 220 to 300 mm and September from 100 to 140 mm. August received the highest rainfall in both years. The total for 2022 was 500 mm against 700 mm in 2023, an increase of 40 per cent. Such a rise is good for farmers but may also cause floods if drainage is poor. The district should clean drains, build check dams and store the rainwater for the dry months." + FA))
G_NEW[9] = [g("Edit: She asked me where did I live.", "She asked me where I lived."),
            g("Fill in the blank with the correct form of the verb: If I ______ (be) you, I would apologise.", "were.")]
NEWB[10] = L("You are Meenu/Mohan, a student of Class 10. Write a letter in 100–120 words to the Principal, requesting for remedial classes in Mathematics before the pre-board examination for students who find the subject difficult.", "Mastermind Public School<br>Jaipur<br>22 November 2026<br>The Principal<br>Mastermind Public School<br>Jaipur<br>Subject: Request for remedial classes in Mathematics<br>Respected Madam/Sir,<br>I am writing on behalf of the students of Class 10 who find Mathematics difficult. Chapters such as Trigonometry and Coordinate Geometry need extra practice, and the regular periods do not give enough time. We therefore request that remedial classes be arranged for forty minutes after school on three days a week until the pre-board examination. We assure you of regular attendance and full cooperation. We shall be extremely grateful for your kind consideration.<br>Yours obediently<br>Meenu/Mohan<br>Class 10 B" + FL)
ANA[10] = (A(AP + "<br><b>Sleeping hours of Class 10 students (survey of 100 students)</b>" + tbl(["Hours of sleep", "Students"], [["Less than 6", "35"], ["6 to 8", "50"], ["More than 8", "15"]]), "The table shows how long 100 students sleep. Half the students, 50, sleep for 6 to 8 hours, which is the recommended range. However, 35 per cent sleep for less than six hours, which is worrying, because lack of sleep reduces concentration and memory. Only 15 per cent sleep for more than eight hours. The figures suggest that a considerable number of students are sacrificing sleep, possibly for study or screens. Parents and teachers should encourage a regular bedtime and discourage late-night phone use. Adequate sleep will help students perform better in the examination." + FA),
      A(AP + "<br><b>Computer ownership in a town (households)</b>" + tbl(["Year", "Households with a computer"], [["2015", "12%"], ["2019", "25%"], ["2023", "48%"]]), "The table shows the percentage of households with a computer in a town. In 2015 only 12 per cent had one; by 2019 the figure had doubled to 25 per cent, and by 2023 it had reached 48 per cent. The sharp rise in the last four years may be due to online classes and work from home. Nevertheless, more than half the households still do not own a computer. The government and schools may provide subsidised devices and set up community computer centres so that every student has equal access to digital learning." + FA))
G_NEW[10] = [g("Edit: One of my friend is a pilot.", "One of my friends is a pilot."),
             g("Fill in the blank with the correct determiner: There are ______ mangoes left in the basket. (a small number)", "a few.")]
